            "diagnosis_secondary.3",
            "diagnosis_secondary.4"
          ],
          "text": "Primary: Necrotising soft-tissue infection, left thigh, with septic shock.\n\nSecondary:\n- Acute kidney injury (requiring CVVH)\n- ARDS\n- ICU-acquired weakness\n- Line sepsis day 14\n- New atrial fibrillation (rate-controlled)",
          "unverified_fact_ids": []
        },
        {
          "section_id": "sections.2",
          "part": "part_a",
          "heading": "key_investigations",
          "fact_ids": [
            "key_investigations.0"
          ],
          "text": "Wound/tissue cultures: Group A Streptococcus and anaerobes identified.",
          "unverified_fact_ids": []
        },
        {
          "section_id": "sections.3",
          "part": "part_a",
          "heading": "treatment",
          "fact_ids": [
