            "treatment.5",
            "treatment.6",
            "treatment.7",
            "treatment.8"
          ],
          "text": "Multi-organ support: intubated and ventilated, noradrenaline, and CVVH for AKI.\n\nMultiple theatre trips: four debridements on days 0, 2, 5 and 9, followed by washout, delayed closure and VAC dressing.\n\nLong course of IV piperacillin-tazobactam, subsequently tailored to benzylpenicillin and clindamycin per microbiology advice.\n\nProne positioning on two occasions for ARDS.\n\nLines changed for line sepsis on day 14.\n\nNutrition via nasogastric tube, progressing to improving oral intake.\n\nRenal recovery achieved; off CVVH by day 16. Extubated day 18. Stepped down to ward day 24.\n\nProlonged rehabilitation and physiotherapy. Wound healing by secondary intention with district nurse and tissue viability input.",
          "unverified_fact_ids": []
        },
